  "body": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This report presents levelised costs for hydrogen production technologies. A \u2018levelised cost\u2019 is the average cost over the lifetime of the plant per MWh of hydrogen produced. It reflects the cost of building and operating a generic plant for each technology. The report details the methodology, data and assumptions used to generate the levelised cost estimates.</p>\n</div>",
